OL,3,GNEWSAClassic car returns to factory
OL,4,Aafter 90 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 90-year-old British sports car has
OL,7,Fmade a a 50-mile journey from its home
OL,8,Fin Warwickshire to the Morgan Motor
OL,9,FCompany in Worcestershire where it
OL,10,Fstarted its life.
OL,12,FThe Morgan 4/4 was built in the Malvern
OL,13,Ffactory in 1936 and became a 21st
OL,14,Fbirthday present for Ruth Bridges in
OL,15,F1982 - and she has had it ever since.
OL,17,FFor more than four decades it has been
OL,18,Fbased in Warwickshire, and is now
OL,19,Flovingly maintained at Bridges' home in
OL,20,FWhitacre Heath.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
