OL,3,GNEWSAClassic car returns to factory
OL,4,Aafter 90 years
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I enjoyed every second, wind in your
OL,7,Fhair - what more could you ask for?"
OL,8,FRuth said after arriving at the factory
OL,9,Fon Monday to show off the model where
OL,10,Fit all began, thrilling staff there.
